{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1253300-demon-the-fallen-v20","id":1253300,"title":"Demon: The Fallen V20","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-11T08:41:29-07:00","id":1253300,"title":"Demon: The Fallen V20","content":"Hello, now that Wraith: The Oblivion V20 is out, can we hope that other games of the Wolrd of Darkness universe could emerge?<br /> <br /> I thought about Demon: The Fallen V20. The game offers a captivating universe (on the mythology of demons and reality), interesting concept on good and evil, an interesting character creation (far from the nice / nasty classic). In the end, it's a balanced game and quite successful, a joy for those who want to play demons (like me).<br /> <br /> I read that many people on the forum (and elsewhere) would be interested in a release of the game in V20.<br /> WE WANT DEMON: THE FALLEN V20 !!!<br /> <br /> What is your opinion on a possible exit from the game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24631-ludo199","name":"ludo199","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-11T09:14:08-07:00","id":1253304,"title":"","content":"No one knows for certain if we're getting a v20 of dtf as it currently stands, Onyx needs to get the rights from ww but again they've nearly finished the transition of other titles, so a man could only hope but they need to fix some aspects of dtf","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.com/v2/137x125q90/661/nSdTJk.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8612-magnus666","name":"magnus666","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8612_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-11T12:52:30-07:00","id":1253357,"title":"","content":"We can only hope so. If we do, I hope they include some of the mechanics tweaks to faith/torment that Devil's Due made, but keeping Lores(but tweaked and re-balanced) and having an apocalyptic form point system based on DD's arcana mechanics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6383,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","user":"Prometheas","date":". 09-12-2018, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","name":"Prometheas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T04:44:01-07:00","id":1253548,"title":"","content":"I would buy it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-20T06:31:23-07:00","id":1255742,"title":"","content":"I've said it before, I'll say it again and I'll keep saying it until we get it:<br /> <br /> Demon: The Fallen 20th Anniversary Edition needs to be exactly 666 pages long.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-20T09:37:14-07:00","id":1255789,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beriorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1253300-demon-the-fallen-v20?p=1255742#post1255742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've said it before, I'll say it again and I'll keep saying it until we get it:<br /> <br /> Demon: The Fallen 20th Anniversary Edition needs to be exactly 666 pages long.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amen brother","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.com/v2/137x125q90/661/nSdTJk.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8612-magnus666","name":"magnus666","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8612_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T10:30:26-07:00","id":1256506,"title":"","content":"Hello, I post here the supplements Demon the fallen that I find &quot;indispensable :<br /> -Demon the Fallen Corerulebook<br /> <br /> -Demon Storytellers Companion (More explication)<br /> &quot;The Demon Storytellers Companion pulls back the veil of secrets on the Earthbound and the reasons for their relentless campaign to enslave the fallen. Expanded information on political factions, storytelling tips on interacting with greater demons and an overview of the events that will shape the course of the game make this an invaluable Storyteller resource.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/3611/Demon-Storytellers-Companion?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/1/3611.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/3611/Demon-Storytellers-Companion?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> Demon Storytellers Companion - White Wolf | Demon: The Fallen | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/3611/Demon-Storytellers-Companion?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/3611/Demon-Storytellers-Companion?cPath=5&amp;it=1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Demon Storytellers Companion - Awake, Arise The seals of Armageddon are sundered, and the damned have shaken off their chains. While the lords of the A </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> -Demon Players Guide (More rules)<br /> &quot;The Demon Players Guide contains a host of new rules, optional powers, tips and guidelines that add new depth to the fallen and their struggles for glory and redemption. Inside you will find expanded systems on customizing a character's apocalyptic form, a more detailed and flexible system for creating infernal items and rules for combining fallen lore paths through intricate and powerful rituals. Combined with valuable character creation tips and an expanded character sheet the Demon Players Guide is an invaluable resource for players and Storytellers alike.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/640/Demon-Players-Guide?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/1/640.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/640/Demon-Players-Guide?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> Demon Players Guide - White Wolf | Demon: The Fallen | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/640/Demon-Players-Guide?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/640/Demon-Players-Guide?cPath=5&amp;it=1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Demon Players Guide - The Ashes of Paradise Once they ruled the earth as gods, radiant spirits of fire and thunder that defied the fury of Hea </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> -City of Angels (Guide of Lost Angeles and <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Infernal Court</span></span>)<br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">City of Angels thrusts players into the power plays, intrigues and betrayals of fallen lords as they vie for control of one of the richest cities in the world. Will you seize the opportunity for power and glory from the talons of your rivals, scheme from the shadows or unite the outcasts of fallen society in a struggle for freedom and the souls of humankind?&quot;</span></span><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/353/City-of-Angels-Demon?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/1/353.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/353/City-of-Angels-Demon?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> City of Angels (Demon) - White Wolf | Demon: The Fallen | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/353/City-of-Angels-Demon?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/353/City-of-Angels-Demon?cPath=5&amp;it=1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> City of Angels (Demon) - City of Dreams It is a city whose influence touches the hearts and minds of millions across the globe. The fallen are </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> -Saviors and Destroyers (Guide of Exorcist)<br /> &quot;Demon: Saviors and Destroyers details the origins and desperate struggles of the world's demon hunters, men and women who place their lives - and souls - on the line to pull the Earth back from the brink of ruin. Character creation guidelines included in this book present these exorcists as an optional character type for players and as a new breed of antagonist for Storytellers to use in their Demon chronicles.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/352/Saviors-and-Destroyers?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/1/352.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/352/Saviors-and-Destroyers?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> Saviors and Destroyers - White Wolf | Demon: The Fallen | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/352/Saviors-and-Destroyers?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/352/Saviors-and-Destroyers?cPath=5&amp;it=1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Saviors and Destroyers - A Prayer for the Faithful Demons walk the Earth. The hide in the hearts of the tormented and the depraved, hungry for </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> -Damned and Deceived <br /> &quot;Demon: Damned and Deceived is an in-depth look at the seductive and often destructive relationships between the fallen and their mortal thralls. Who do the fallen seek as potential partners in a Faustian bond? What gifts do they offer, and why? Can a mortal make a deal with the Devil and survive, or is every thrall destined for madness and death?&quot;<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/99/Damned-and-Deceived?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/1/99.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/99/Damned-and-Deceived?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> Damned and Deceived - White Wolf | Demon: The Fallen | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/99/Damned-and-Deceived?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/99/Damned-and-Deceived?cPath=5&amp;it=1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Damned and Deceived - A Whisper in the Darkness They seek the ambitious, vengeful, crippled and bereft. Men and women who feel cheated by th </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> -Houses of the Fallen (Guide of Infernal House)<br /> &quot;Demon: Houses of the Fallen provides an in-depth look into each of the seven Houses of the infernal host, exploring their history and exploits during the Fall and the War of Wrath. Though twisted by the suffering of their long exile, the fallen still bear the spark of their former glory, and the ancient ties of House loyalties are not easily forgotten.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/1444/Houses-of-the-Fallen?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/1/1444.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/1444/Houses-of-the-Fallen?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> Houses of the Fallen - White Wolf | Demon: The Fallen | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/1444/Houses-of-the-Fallen?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/1444/Houses-of-the-Fallen?cPath=5&amp;it=1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Houses of the Fallen - Angels of Wrath The seven ages of Creation spawned seven Celestial Houses of angels, each one created to govern its own </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> -Earthbound (Guide of Earthbound)<br /> &quot;Demon: The Earthbound details the origins, history and power of these monstrous spirits, revered in the past as gods and twisted by centuries of mortal worship and depraved sacrifice. No longer angels nor wholly demons, the Earthbound are the nightmarish products of divine power and the darkest parts of the human soul.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/119/Earthbound?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/1/119.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/119/Earthbound?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> Earthbound - White Wolf | Demon: The Fallen | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/119/Earthbound?cPath=5&amp;it=1\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/119/Earthbound?cPath=5&amp;it=1 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Earthbound - In the Deep Places of the Earth They have slumbered for centuries, dreaming of the day when they will rise again. In a </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> -Time of Judgment (Scenario of Judgment, The End of the World) =&gt; Not really necessary)<br /> <br /> What do you think ?<br /> <br /> And 666 it&quot;s the perfect Number of pages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24631-ludo199","name":"ludo199","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T13:06:28-07:00","id":1256527,"title":"","content":"Those better not be in order.<br /> <br /> Must Have: Core, Players Guide, Houses of the Fallen, Earthbound.<br /> Should Have: ST Companion, Damned &amp; Deceived.<br /> Could Have: Time of Judgment, Days of Fire, City of Angels, Demon Translation Guide.<br /> Would Have: Saviors &amp; Destroyers, Fear to Tread, Trilogy of the Fallen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T11:30:49-07:00","id":1260318,"title":"","content":"I'd rather see a Hunter: The Reckoning 20, but I doubt we'll see anymore X20 lines with V5 out and Wr20 and C20 finally given a full release.<br /> <br /> Shame really, because while I don't care for Demon, it does have its fans and I'd like to see X20 updates for Hunter and the other remaining game lines as well.<br /> <br /> Of course, one could do a fan update to X20 like they did with Street Fighter, and like what I intend to do with Senshi: The Merchandising.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1579,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","user":"Camilla","date":". 10-12-2018, 02:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T17:27:01-07:00","id":1260372,"title":"","content":"Demon the Fallen was released in 2002. It means the fans would have to until 2022 for a 20th Anniversary Edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1119-primal-flame","name":"Primal Flame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"230"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T17:33:19-07:00","id":1260373,"title":"","content":"YES YES YES <br /> YES YES YES<br /> YES YES YES<br /> YES YES YES <br /> YES YES YES<br /> YES YES YES","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-14T12:57:13-07:00","id":1260549,"title":"","content":"Just thought that this thread could be relevant. It is about changes that D20 would need/be better with.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1225497-how-would-you-do-d-tf#post1225497\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1225497-how-would-you-do-d-tf#post1225497\"> How Would You Do D:TF? - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1225497-how-would-you-do-d-tf#post1225497\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1225497-how-would-you-do-d-tf#post1225497 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> If you were the one in charge of making a new Demon: The Fallen edition how would you go about it? How would you change the rules and setting while still remaining faithful to the original design? </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"htt